hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"173","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Use qabr ke azab se bacha. [Bacche ke janaze mein:] Ae Allah! Use walidain ke liye peshrau, zakheera aur qubul shafaat karne wala bana. Ae Allah! Us se un ke tarazu bhari kar, us se un ke ujoor bade kar, use saleh mominon se mila, use Ibrahim ki kafalat mein de, apni rahmat se use jahannam ke azab se bacha; use us ke ghar se behtar ghar, ahal se behtar ahal de. Ae Allah! Hamare aglon, bacchon aur iman mein hum se sabqat karne walon ko bakhsh de. [Bacche ke janaze mein padhe]"
"174","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Use hamare liye peshrau, pehle jaane wala aur ajr bana. [Bacche ke janaze mein padhe]"
